[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあっ……はあっ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*pant* *pant*"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……星の神よ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... Star God help us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうか、我らをお救いください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please, save us all!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さん！\u3000お母さん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mother! Father!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、アルビーナ！\u3000無事だったんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina! Thank goodness you're safe!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Father"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どこに行っていたの？\u3000心配したのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Where have you been? We were so worried!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "母親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いったい何があったの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's happening?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "島の近くの海に巨大な魔物が現れたそうなんだ。\n魔物が島に近づかないよう、こうして祈っている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A massive monster has appeared in the waters near the island. Everyone's praying it won't come any closer."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Father"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A monster...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップちゃん。状況を確認しに行くわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, Bepp. Let's go assess the situation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かった。姉様、また後で",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood. I'll see you later, Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしも、宿に戻ってみんなの様子を見てくるわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm heading back to check on everyone at the inn!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロマンさん！\u3000いったい何が起きてるんでしょう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman! What's going on?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大変なことになった……\n頂獣クヴァレルガらしき影が海に現れたんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've got trouble... They've spotted what looks like the Apexi Kvarelga in the sea!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええっ！？\nクヴァレルガは、アタシたちが倒したはずじゃ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What!? But we defeated Kvarelga..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まさか、別の個体が……？\u3000いや、そんなはずは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could there be another one...? No, that's impossible..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "トトリたちが海のほうを見張ってくれている。\n今のところは沖に留まっているようだが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori and the others are watching the coast. For now, it's staying offshore, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと待って……それ、結構まずいかも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait... this could be really bad."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今日は島から定期船が出航する日なんだよ。\nそれも、ちょうど日程が被ってて、何隻も一緒に！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ships are scheduled to depart today. And several of them will be leaving right now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣を放っておいたら、船が襲われちゃう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we leave that Apexi out there, it'll go after the ships!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずいよ！\u3000なんとかしないと！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This would be bad! We have to do something!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000ロマンさん、私たち行ってきます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right! Roman, we're heading out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、アタシも……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, I'm coming too...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ。どこへ行くつもりだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina. Where do you think you're going?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Father"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また、天命に背いて危ないことをしようとしているの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you planning to defy your divine calling again with such behavior?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "母親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さん、お母さん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mother, father..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫。あの人たちを海岸まで案内してあげるだけ。\nこれも案内人としての仕事だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry. I'm just guiding them to the shore. It's part of my duties as a Star Guide."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm off!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、アルビーナ！\u3000待ちなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, Alvina!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Father"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]